        // answered EINVAL(22) to every call — getpid, write and mprotect
        // alike — and std/alloc.kr's guard probe correctly concluded that
        // nothing it could see behaved like mprotect. macOS x86_64 was
        // unaffected because its number register is rax either way.
        //
